# L16 touchscreen (Synaptics RMI4). In landscape (phoc transform 270) the bottom screen
# edge is raw X = 0, and a swipe from the bezel reports exactly 0, which maps onto the
# output's far boundary: the touch lands on no surface and Phosh's home bar swipe is
# missed. Pull raw X in by 1% so the edge lands a few pixels inside the screen.
ACTION=="add|change", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{name}=="Synaptics s2726", ENV{LIBINPUT_CALIBRATION_MATRIX}="0.99 0 0.01 0 1 0"
